# Read by `npm run build` only (Create React App). Rebuild + redeploy after changes.
#
# ── Sandbox sites ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
#   ERP:   https://sandbox-erp.schoolmentor.ai/
#   Chain: https://sandbox-chain.schoolmentor.ai/
#   Admin: https://sandbox-admin.schoolmentor.ai/
#   API:   https://sandbox-alphaapi.schoolmentor.ai/
#
# ── Production sites ───────────────────────────────────────────────
#   ERP:   https://erp.schoolmentor.ai/
#   Chain: https://chain.schoolmentor.ai/
#   Admin: https://admin.schoolmentor.ai/
#   API:   https://alphaapi.schoolmentor.ai/  (via IIS on ERP origin)
#
# SINGLE API SWITCH — REACT_APP_API_BASE_URL drives /api + SuperAdmin + Chain API + media.
# Prefer the ERP site origin (IIS reverse-proxies). Direct alphaapi also works if CORS allows.

# ── Currently: SANDBOX ──
REACT_APP_API_BASE_URL=https://sandbox-erp.schoolmentor.ai
REACT_APP_CHAIN_URL=https://sandbox-chain.schoolmentor.ai



# ── Production (swap to these, comment sandbox above) ──
# REACT_APP_API_BASE_URL=https://erp.schoolmentor.ai
# REACT_APP_CHAIN_URL=https://chain.schoolmentor.ai
